 fn();
}


🔹 8. Callback Functions
Function passed into another function.

setTimeout(() => {
 console.log("Hello");
},1000);


🔹 9. Closures ⭐
Inner function remembers outer variables.

function outer(){
 let count = 0;

 return function(){
   count++;
 };
}
Uses
* data privacy
* counters
* caching

